# Fictional suppression-ledger fixture — schema of record for --ledger.
# Every person below is invented. The real ledger is NOT in this repo: it names
# real creators and records their opt-outs, and this repo is public (SPO-415).
#
# One JSON object per line. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#   at      required, non-empty ISO 8601 instant the signal was observed.
#   reason  required, one of: replied, stop_requested, unsubscribed,
#           bounced, complained, manual.
#   email / xHandle
#           at least ONE must survive normalization. Presence is not enough —
#           "   " and "@" are truthy and both normalize to null, which is an
#           opt-out that matches nobody.
#   note    optional free text.
#
# An opt-out on either channel silences BOTH channels.
